│                          │ regime changes. When vol_of_vol is high, the market regime is shifting rapidly—exactly    │
│                          │ when the model fails at the val boundary. These features measure CHANGE in market         │
│                          │ character, not just current state.                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Also add adaptive feature scaling that normalizes by realized volatility rather than      │
│                          │ fixed rolling windows, making features regime-invariant across train/test/val.            │
