╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ increase_expressivity_add_rate_features                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ This edit increases XGBoost model expressivity and adds explicit rate-of-change features  │
│                          │ to detect regime shifts:                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Hyperparameter adjustments**:                                                        │
│                          │    - Increase max_depth from 3 to 4 (allow slightly deeper trees to capture non-linear    │
│                          │ regime patterns)                                                                          │
│                          │    - Reduce reg_lambda from 4.0 to 2.0 (less L2 penalization allows model to fit stronger │
│                          │ signals)                                                                                  │
│                          │    - Reduce reg_alpha from 0.6 to 0.3 (less L1 penalization)                              │
│                          │    - Increase learning_rate from 0.035 to 0.055 (faster learning while maintaining        │
│                          │ stability)                                                                                │
│                          │    - Reduce n_estimators from 520 to 400 (avoid over-training with lower regularization)  │
│                          │    - Increase early_stopping_rounds from 45 to 60 (patience for lower-regularization      │
│                          │ model)                                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Feature engineering improvements**:                                                  │
│                          │    - Add "rate of change" features: vol_trend_rate, eff_trend_rate, bb_momentum that      │
│                          │ measure acceleration/deceleration of market character                                     │
│                          │    - Replace longer look-back z-score windows (40→20) to make features more responsive to │
│                          │ recent regime shifts                                                                      │
│                          │    - Add short-window efficiency metrics that detect quick market changes                 │
│                          │    - Remove some redundant longer-window features (vol_rank_60, multiple z-scores on same │
│                          │ feature) to reduce noise                                                                  │
│                          │    - Add price-momentum ratio features that normalize momentum by recent volatility in a  │
