│                          │ `min_child_weight` to 40. This forces the model to find patterns that apply to large      │
│                          │ subsets of the data, preventing it from fitting the specific "shape" of the training      │
│                          │ period.                                                                                   │
│                          │ 5.  **Regularization**: Added L1 (reg_alpha) and L2 (reg_lambda) to further penalize      │
